# Stream U (govqa-watch.yml) ONLY: the headless browser for the GovQA keyword
# sweep (govqa_client.PlaywrightGrid, imported lazily). Kept out of the main
# requirements.in on purpose, so the other ~46 workflows don't download a
# 46 MB wheel + Chromium they never use. Lives in its own hashed lockfile so
# Dependabot's pip-compile support sees it and proposes upgrades (it sat at
# 1.58 while 1.64 shipped, and broke when ubuntu-latest became 26.04 on
# 2026-10-28; Ubuntu 26.04 needs >= 1.61). The -c keeps shared transitive
# deps (typing-extensions, greenlet) at the main lockfile's versions.
-c requirements.txt
playwright>=1.64.1
